Reason: an off-screen embedder (notolibra/engine's view bridge, plan.md §2.5)
receives RenderWidgetHostViewMac's NSView calls itself: cursors, <select>
popups and IME state arrive as data, and the rest pass on to the in-process
NSView. RenderWidgetHostViewMac::SetEmbedderNSView sets ns_view_, the
pointer Chromium already uses for remote (app shim) NSViews. No upstream bug.

